WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/system/components/state-machine/LiveControls.tsx — a PURELY CONTROLLED FSM-debugger toolbar
  (prompt data sources: useTranslation only; shared components used: @/components/ui; charts/maps: none). It
  fetches nothing — its parent (the debugger page) owns the transition buffer and passes the control props +
  callbacks down. Composition:
    container  : flex-wrap toolbar (rounded-lg border bg-white/[0.02] px-3 py-2)
    Live       : <Button> variant=primary when isLive else secondary; aria-pressed=isLive; LEADING status dot
                 (emerald-300 animate-pulse when live, surface-2 when not); onClick → onToggleLive(true)
    Freeze     : <Button> variant=primary when !isLive else secondary; aria-pressed=!isLive; onToggleLive(false)
    step-prev  : <Button variant=ghost> "←"; disabled=!canStepPrev; aria-label "Step to previous transition"
    step-next  : <Button variant=ghost> "→"; disabled=!canStepNext; aria-label "Step to next transition"
    Window     : <Caption> "Window" (hidden sm:inline) + <Select> value=windowMinutes options 5/10/30/120 min;
                 aria-label "Window"; onChange → onWindowChange(Number)
    Clear      : <Button variant=ghost> "Clear buffer"; onClick → onClearBuffer
    counter    : ml-auto <Tooltip content=tooltipLabel><Caption cursor-help data-testid=live-controls-counter>
    counter math (VERBATIM): inWindow = windowCount ?? bufferCount ?? 0 ; total = totalCount ?? bufferCount ?? 0 ;
                 outside = max(0, total - inWindow) ; dual = totalCount != null || windowCount != null
                 label = (dual && outside>0) ? "{{inWindow}} in window · {{total}} in 24 h" : "{{n}} buffered"
                 tooltip = "Counts inside the {{minutes}}-minute Window dropdown. {{outside}} more transitions
                            fetched in the last 24 h."
    The deprecated single-scope `bufferCount` prop is preserved as the migration fallback for BOTH scopes.
  Extracted i18n keys (9): debugger.controls.{live, freeze, stepPrev, stepNext, window, clear, buffered,
                            bufferedDual, bufferedTooltip}. The WINDOW_OPTIONS labels ("5 min"/"10 min"/"30 min"/
                            "2 h") are web literals → lifted to keyed strings so no English literal lives in native.

